{"4638280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Peter the Stash Hunter", "steam_appid": 4638280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/742dec1ae77564fbc3051c4239ed3d1f.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/742dec1ae77564fbc3051c4239ed3d1f.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/742dec1ae77564fbc3051c4239ed3d1f.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- His grandfather is missing. The clues are in the lockers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peter's grandfather vanished without a trace years ago. All that's left are abandoned storage units and items no one can make sense of. By day, gather clues from auctions; by night, run your second-hand shop to bankroll the search. A business sim, looting, and strategy game, all turning on a family secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/fe7144dde6c8383ac0043cbb9894f8df.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1140 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Auction Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the auction begins, so does the battle. Read clues from the shape of the boxes and the way items are arranged. Push rivals back with sabotage cards. English-style bidding wars or Dutch-style descending-price tension? Every auction demands a different tactic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/a983b3a47d8a2f3240808f63873ccbde.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/a983b3a47d8a2f3240808f63873ccbde.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/a983b3a47d8a2f3240808f63873ccbde.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Loot the Storage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door of the unit you won and ransack what's inside. Cut tape, pick locks, find hidden compartments, smash crates with rhythm mini-games. You might pull out a worthless T-shirt, a rare antique collectors will pay a fortune for. Sometimes, an unexpected piece of your grandfather's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/612db3eb564c2aaa278d35f971ec5559.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/612db3eb564c2aaa278d35f971ec5559.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/612db3eb564c2aaa278d35f971ec5559.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange shelves, set prices, haggle, advertise, expand. Customers have different tastes and budgets; selling the right item to the right person is an art in itself. As your reputation grows, wealthier customers start walking through your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/1cb1a4973e1bd1d2813aa27428b7a444.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/1cb1a4973e1bd1d2813aa27428b7a444.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/1cb1a4973e1bd1d2813aa27428b7a444.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Peter's day is never routine.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train with gym mini-games to grow stronger and haul heavier loot. Watch your back leaving the auction; if a rival won't let go, start your vehicle and brace for a harpoon chase. Earn respect by battling rival buyers, each with their own strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peter's journey doesn't end with building an empire. Every box you open brings him one step closer to his grandfather's secret.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/742dec1ae77564fbc3051c4239ed3d1f.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/742dec1ae77564fbc3051c4239ed3d1f.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/742dec1ae77564fbc3051c4239ed3d1f.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- His grandfather is missing. The clues are in the lockers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peter's grandfather vanished without a trace years ago. All that's left are abandoned storage units and items no one can make sense of. By day, gather clues from auctions; by night, run your second-hand shop to bankroll the search. A business sim, looting, and strategy game, all turning on a family secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/fe7144dde6c8383ac0043cbb9894f8df.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1140 height=214 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Auction Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the auction begins, so does the battle. Read clues from the shape of the boxes and the way items are arranged. Push rivals back with sabotage cards. English-style bidding wars or Dutch-style descending-price tension? Every auction demands a different tactic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/a983b3a47d8a2f3240808f63873ccbde.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/a983b3a47d8a2f3240808f63873ccbde.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/a983b3a47d8a2f3240808f63873ccbde.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Loot the Storage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door of the unit you won and ransack what's inside. Cut tape, pick locks, find hidden compartments, smash crates with rhythm mini-games. You might pull out a worthless T-shirt, a rare antique collectors will pay a fortune for. Sometimes, an unexpected piece of your grandfather's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/612db3eb564c2aaa278d35f971ec5559.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/612db3eb564c2aaa278d35f971ec5559.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/612db3eb564c2aaa278d35f971ec5559.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange shelves, set prices, haggle, advertise, expand. Customers have different tastes and budgets; selling the right item to the right person is an art in itself. As your reputation grows, wealthier customers start walking through your door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/1cb1a4973e1bd1d2813aa27428b7a444.poster.avif?t=1786972079\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/1cb1a4973e1bd1d2813aa27428b7a444.webm?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/extras/1cb1a4973e1bd1d2813aa27428b7a444.mp4?t=1786972079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Peter's day is never routine.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train with gym mini-games to grow stronger and haul heavier loot. Watch your back leaving the auction; if a rival won't let go, start your vehicle and brace for a harpoon chase. Earn respect by battling rival buyers, each with their own strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peter's journey doesn't end with building an empire. Every box you open brings him one step closer to his grandfather's secret.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A business sim + looting + strategy hybrid. Outbid rival hunters at storage auctions, ransack what you win, then run the shop that bankrolls Peter's search for his missing grandfather. Sabotage cards, Dutch vs English bidding, harpoon chases. Every box could hide a secret.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Russian, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/6608e41f2c8141893222b9f78aaf32d0211dc2da/header.jpg?t=1786972079", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/74750fd8f6ada4f53c2fe0caea386643814c0bf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786972079", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4638280/74750fd8f6ada4f53c2fe0caea386643814c0bf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786972079", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Fragilent"], "publishers": ["Fragilent"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "St